'''Angry Explosion''' is the only stage in '''Oddity in the Desert III''', which appears after clearing [[Scorching Sands Area 16]]. It drops no items, but unlocks stages 17-19 of [[Ashvini Desert]] when cleared. It was added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

