==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*8 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Elephantidae Papaou]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zapy|Zapies]] spawn, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
**3 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
**6 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**6 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**6 [[Formicidaean Ariant]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The goal here is to exhaust the strong peons without Elephantidae Papaou getting to your base, the 3 Zapies pose a huge threat with their high health and speed, there are 5 Zang Roos that will unborrow on your backliners losing you ground and the 6 Formicidaean Ariants will try and nuke all your attackers.

Stall the start for money. You want at least 2/3 meatshields to stall both Zapy and Elephantidae Papaou; [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] is recommended for stalling the Zombies with Research [[Cat Combo]]s. [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] will deal with the Zombies. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] can be used to kill Ragin' Gory, and helps in dealing with the other Zombies. Cat Cannon Recharge Cat Combos can be helpful to have a [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] for every Zang Roo.

