==Trivia==
*Angry Explosion's name refers to the anger of [[Elephantidae Papaou]] and [[Ragin' Gory]] and the explosive abdomen of [[Formicidaean Ariant]].
**It may also reference [[wikia:dragonball:Majin Buu|Majin Buu]]'s [[wikia:dragonball:Angry Explosion|ultimate attack of the same name]] from ''Dragon Ball''.

